OL,3,ATourette's film I Swear wins three
OL,4,AScottish Baftas
OL,5,
OL,6,FI Swear was the big winner at the Bafta
OL,7,FScotland awards on Sunday.
OL,9,FThe film about Tourette syndrome
OL,10,Fcampaigner John Davidson won Best Film,
OL,11,FBest Director and Best Actor.
OL,13,FThe condition causes involuntary vocal
OL,14,Fand physical tics and, in Davidson's
OL,15,Fcase, coprolalia, which causes him to
OL,16,Fshout offensive and inappropriate
OL,17,Fphrases.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
