OL,3,ATourette's film I Swear wins three
OL,4,AScottish Baftas
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavidson was at the centre of
OL,7,Fcontroversy when he attended the Bafta
OL,8,Ffilm awards earlier this year. His
OL,9,Fshouts, which included a racial slur,
OL,10,Fwere heard in the hall during the event
OL,11,Fand broadcast in the BBC coverage of
OL,12,Fthe event.
